    "name": "Augmented Empire",
    "steam_appid": 2856600,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856600/extras/40962f87d9577d47a3cc2e79c7d5e277.poster.avif?t=1744812384\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856600/extras/40962f87d9577d47a3cc2e79c7d5e277.webm?t=1744812384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856600/extras/40962f87d9577d47a3cc2e79c7d5e277.mp4?t=1744812384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Augmented Empire</strong> combines an engaging dystopian story with turn-based RPG strategy featuring an All-Star Cast \u2013 including the voice talents of Kate Mulgrew, Nick Frost and Garrick Hagon. Now arriving on PC, this acclaimed title delivers a refined cyberpunk experience with full controller support and additional accessibility improvements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the safety of your secluded hideout, guide a ragtag team of misfits and outlaws through a city torn apart by class divisions and corruption. Overthrow the elite in this turn-based RPG that blends tactical strategy with rich storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856600/extras/241a730830dc756f7b9cf8f6b306617f.poster.avif?t=1744812384\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856600/extras/241a730830dc756f7b9cf8f6b306617f.webm?t=1744812384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856600/extras/241a730830dc756f7b9cf8f6b306617f.mp4?t=1744812384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The definitive edition:</strong> Based on the highly praised Oculus Quest version, now enhanced for PC.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical RPG gameplay:</strong> Command six unique characters, each with their own skills, across 26 missions and 60 handcrafted environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging dystopian story:</strong> Unravel a tale of rebellion and survival, featuring voice acting by an All-Star Cast, including Kate Mulgrew, Nick Frost, and Garrick Hagon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhanced Accessibility:</strong> Enjoy full controller support along with additional accessibility improvements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customisable progression:</strong> Develop your team\u2019s abilities and upgrades to suit your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hours of immersion:</strong> Enjoy up to 10 hours of gameplay packed with turn-based action and cyberpunk intrigue.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a long-time fan or a first-time player, experience <strong>Augmented Empire</strong> like never before. Are you ready to rise against the corrupt elite and reclaim New Savannah?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856600/extras/40962f87d9577d47a3cc2e79c7d5e277.poster.avif?t=1744812384\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856600/extras/40962f87d9577d47a3cc2e79c7d5e277.webm?t=1744812384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856600/extras/40962f87d9577d47a3cc2e79c7d5e277.mp4?t=1744812384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Augmented Empire</strong> combines an engaging dystopian story with turn-based RPG strategy featuring an All-Star Cast \u2013 including the voice talents of Kate Mulgrew, Nick Frost and Garrick Hagon. Now arriving on PC, this acclaimed title delivers a refined cyberpunk experience with full controller support and additional accessibility improvements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the safety of your secluded hideout, guide a ragtag team of misfits and outlaws through a city torn apart by class divisions and corruption. Overthrow the elite in this turn-based RPG that blends tactical strategy with rich storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856600/extras/241a730830dc756f7b9cf8f6b306617f.poster.avif?t=1744812384\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856600/extras/241a730830dc756f7b9cf8f6b306617f.webm?t=1744812384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856600/extras/241a730830dc756f7b9cf8f6b306617f.mp4?t=1744812384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The definitive edition:</strong> Based on the highly praised Oculus Quest version, now enhanced for PC.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical RPG gameplay:</strong> Command six unique characters, each with their own skills, across 26 missions and 60 handcrafted environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging dystopian story:</strong> Unravel a tale of rebellion and survival, featuring voice acting by an All-Star Cast, including Kate Mulgrew, Nick Frost, and Garrick Hagon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhanced Accessibility:</strong> Enjoy full controller support along with additional accessibility improvements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customisable progression:</strong> Develop your team\u2019s abilities and upgrades to suit your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hours of immersion:</strong> Enjoy up to 10 hours of gameplay packed with turn-based action and cyberpunk intrigue.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a long-time fan or a first-time player, experience <strong>Augmented Empire</strong> like never before. Are you ready to rise against the corrupt elite and reclaim New Savannah?</p>",
    "short_description": "Step into New Savannah, 2058 - a city divided by class and corruption, where your tactical choices spark a cyberpunk revolution. Assemble a team of misfits and lead them through 26 intense missions with deep strategy and immersive storytelling. Every decision shapes your rebellion.",
